stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending
    Pending --> Paid : payment captured
    Pending --> Cancelled : timeout (30 min)
    Paid --> Fulfilment

    state Fulfilment {
        [*] --> Picking
        Picking --> Packing
        Packing --> Shipped : label printed
        Shipped --> [*]
    }

    Fulfilment --> Delivered
    Fulfilment --> Returned : customer return
    Returned --> Refunded
    Delivered --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of Pending
        Holds stock for 30 minutes
        before releasing it.
    end note
